<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="card shadow-sm p-4" style="border-radius: 12px;">

    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">DNS Lookup Tool – Check Domain Records Instantly</h2>

    <p>
        Our free <strong>DNS lookup tool</strong> allows you to check domain DNS records such as A records and MX records instantly.
        It helps you troubleshoot domain issues, verify configurations, and understand how domains connect to servers.
    </p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">What is DNS?</h2>
    <p>
        DNS (Domain Name System) translates domain names into IP addresses so browsers can load websites.
    </p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">How to Use This Tool</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Enter a domain name (e.g., example.com)</li>
        <li>Click "Lookup DNS"</li>
        <li>View DNS records instantly</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Types of DNS Records</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>A Record:</strong> Maps domain to IP address</li>
        <li><strong>MX Record:</strong> Defines mail servers</li>
        <li><strong>CNAME:</strong> Alias for another domain</li>
        <li><strong>TXT:</strong> Stores verification data</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Use Cases</h2>

    <h4 class="mt-3">1. Website Troubleshooting</h4>
    <p>Check if your domain points to the correct server.</p>

    <h4 class="mt-3">2. Email Setup</h4>
    <p>Verify MX records for email delivery.</p>

    <h4 class="mt-3">3. Security Checks</h4>
    <p>Validate DNS configurations to prevent issues.</p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">FAQ</h2>

    <h4>What is an A record?</h4>
    <p>An A record maps a domain to its IP address.</p>

    <h4>What is an MX record?</h4>
    <p>An MX record specifies mail servers for a domain.</p>

    <h4>Is this DNS lookup tool free?</h4>
    <p>Yes, it is completely free and requires no signup.</p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Conclusion</h2>
    <p>
        Use our DNS lookup tool to quickly analyze domain records and troubleshoot issues.
        It is fast, accurate, and works on all devices.
    </p>

</div>

</div>

